.section VERSION
postui 1.0.0 (M5-004, wave postui-v1). First tagged release.
Requires paideia-as v0.34+ toolchain. Ships alongside three
reference-app satellites (`postui-top`, `postui-hex`,
`postui-dmesg`) each built against this library over the
paideia-os R89 KIND_TUI_CANVAS substrate.
